OL,3,APopular Australian children's author
OL,4,Ajailed over child exploitation offences
OL,5,
OL,6,FAustralian children's author Craig
OL,7,FSilvey has been sentenced to seven
OL,8,Fmonths in jail for possessing and
OL,9,Fdistributing child exploitation
OL,10,Fmaterial.
OL,12,FIn handing down her sentence, Judge
OL,13,FHayley Cormann called Silvey's actions
OL,14,F"repulsive" and "degrading".
