OL,3,APopular Australian children's author
OL,4,Ajailed over child exploitation offences
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn January, Silvey was arrested after
OL,7,Fpolice raided his home in Western
OL,8,FAustralia and seized several electronic
OL,9,Fdevices. In May, the 44-year-old
OL,10,Fpleaded guilty to possessing and
OL,11,Fdistributing child exploitation
OL,12,Fmaterial and in October he was jailed
OL,13,Fpending his sentencing.
OL,15,FThe father-of-three is best known for
OL,16,Fhis award-winning young adult novel
OL,17,FJasper Jones and children's book Runt,
OL,18,Fboth of which were later made into
OL,19,Fmovies.
